  "bubble.kaleidoscope_grilling.maid_grilling.start.1": "狗修金！今天的烤串交给我吧！",
  "bubble.kaleidoscope_grilling.maid_grilling.start.2": "狗修金！炭火和食材都到位，开烤啦！",
  "bubble.kaleidoscope_grilling.maid_grilling.start.3": "主人请坐稳，今天由我掌管火候！",
  "bubble.kaleidoscope_grilling.maid_grilling.missing_skewer.1": "主人，大事不好了，生串用完了！",
  "bubble.kaleidoscope_grilling.maid_grilling.missing_skewer.2": "狗修金！生肉串集体离家出走了！",
  "bubble.kaleidoscope_grilling.maid_grilling.missing_skewer.3": "主人，大事不好了，我还在，生肉串没了！",
  "bubble.kaleidoscope_grilling.maid_grilling.missing_flint.1": "炭火罢工啦，打火石去哪里了？",
  "bubble.kaleidoscope_grilling.maid_grilling.missing_flint.2": "狗修金！万事俱备，东风把打火石吹走了！",
  "bubble.kaleidoscope_grilling.maid_grilling.missing_flint.3": "主人，烧烤架还冷着，点火的家伙不见了！",
  "bubble.kaleidoscope_grilling.maid_grilling.missing_oil.1": "没有油怎么烤嘛，会粘住的！",
  "bubble.kaleidoscope_grilling.maid_grilling.missing_oil.2": "狗修金！油壶比你的钱包还干净！",
  "bubble.kaleidoscope_grilling.maid_grilling.missing_oil.3": "主人，再不补油，烤串要和架子粘在一起啦！",
  "bubble.kaleidoscope_grilling.maid_grilling.missing_seasoning.1": "少了这瓶灵魂，烤串会哭的！",
  "bubble.kaleidoscope_grilling.maid_grilling.missing_seasoning.2": "主人！没有调料的话，这批烤串会失去灵魂的！",
  "bubble.kaleidoscope_grilling.maid_grilling.missing_seasoning.3": "狗修金！调料瓶空空如也，我被迫下班了！",
  "bubble.kaleidoscope_grilling.maid_grilling.output_full.1": "主人，成品没地方放啦！",
  "bubble.kaleidoscope_grilling.maid_grilling.output_full.2": "主人，出货箱已经被烤串攻占啦！",
  "bubble.kaleidoscope_grilling.maid_grilling.output_full.3": "狗修金！再烤下去，成品只能堆到我头上了！",
  "bubble.kaleidoscope_grilling.maid_grilling.done.1": "完美收工！趁热吃，我可不等人哦！",
